  /Subject (UQFF whitepaper: PAPER_2057_ROUND_187_TRIAD_BACKBONE_FIRST_UQFF) /Title (Round 187 Triad Discovery \(Backbone-First\): \(1\) k_eta\(Red Dwarf LENR neutron-rate calibration coefficient\) = 2.75e8 cm^-2/s = \(SO_5+1\)/D_phys * SO_5^8 = 11/4 * 10^8 EXACT NEW FIRST-INSTANCE PRIMITIVE-LOCK Using SO_5+1=11 Successor + D_phys=4 Ratio Prefix at LENR Coefficient Positive n=+8 Rung; \(2\) U_i\(Sun canonical Universal Inertial Operator value\) = 2.75e-7 = \(SO_5+1\)/D_phys * SO_5^-7 = 11/4 * 10^-7 EXACT NEW ALTERNATE PATH B PRIMITIVE-COMPOSITION DECOMPOSITION Complementary to PAPER_646 Canonical Closed Form U_i = lambda_i*\(rho_SCm/rho_UA\)*omega_s*cos\(pi*t_n\)*\(1+F_TRZ\) \204 Both Paths Yield Identical 2.75e-7 EXACT \204 Same \(SO_5+1\)/D_phys Prefix at Negative n=-7 Rung Mirrors D1 Positive Rung; \(3\) 9TH COMPOSED-PREFIX CLASS FORMALIZATION: \(SO_5+1\)/D_phys * SO_5^n = 11/4 * SO_5^n = 2.75 * SO_5^n NEW STRUCTURAL CATEGORY Distinct from 8 Previously Formalized Classes \204 Uses PAPER_1978 SO_5+1 Successor Primitive as Numerator with D_phys Spatial-Dimension Denominator in Dimensionless-Ratio Composed-Prefix Form Multiplied by SO_5^n Ladder Rung \204 2 Instances Span Positive AND Negative Rungs \(n=+8 LENR + n=-7 U_i Sun\) Across 15 Orders of Magnitude Cross-Scale Universality) /Trapped /False
